{"id":"01ffc83c15317e143fec1cb6b48ffbe41934abc53db7b98ab9cb6bc748ac23e0","pubkey":"ebe49d8a048ba6b9382ad2bc0528cc614079dbc0182ad6f1e91aba1270b4f1cd","created_at":1781916583,"content":"# Table of Contents\n\n### Research papers\n\n- *The earliest holders of the lands of Kincaid, 27 June 2014* (https://archive.org/details/early-kincaidlands)\n- *The lands of Kincaid in relation to the Highlands of Scotland, 11 December 2011* (https://archive.org/details/highland_202606)\n- *The Lairds of Kincaid and Craiglockhart castle, 27 April 2014* (https://archive.org/details/craiglockhart-tower)\n- *The similarity of Kincaid and Crawford coat of arms, 22 January 2012* (https://archive.org/details/coatofarms)\n- *Possible origins of the early Kincaid coat of arms, 4 February 2012* (https://archive.org/details/armsorigin)\n- *Further evidence for Kincaid descent from Robert de Crauford, constable of\nEdinburgh Castle, 27 October 2019* (https://archive.org/details/robertde-crauford-arms)\n- *Documents pertaining to the Lairds of Kincaid, 1425 – 1914, 29 June 2014* (https://archive.org/details/Lairds)\n- *Hamiltons of Bardowie – First known superiors of the Kincaids for\ntheir ancestral lands, 24 June 2017* (https://archive.org/details/hamilton-bardowie)\n- *A prosperous early Kincaid line in France, 25 October 2012* (https://archive.org/details/Montifault)\n\n---\n\n&#x1F6A7;&nbsp;&nbsp;Contents under construction.  Updated to 19 June 2026.","tags":[["alt","A short note: # Table of Contents\n\n### Research papers\n\n- *The e..."],["r","https://archive.org/details/hamilton-bardowie"],["r","https://archive.org/details/robertde-crauford-arms"],["r","https://archive.org/details/early-kincaidlands"],["r","https://archive.org/details/Lairds"],["r","https://archive.org/details/armsorigin"],["r","https://archive.org/details/coatofarms"],["r","https://archive.org/details/craiglockhart-tower"],["r","https://archive.org/details/Montifault"],["r","https://archive.org/details/highland_202606"],