{"id":"55014b933596442d25086c8b8c2e7a687b6e248adf55e91a34ddffe35f329eb5","pubkey":"4c5d5379a066339c88f6e101e3edb1fbaee4ede3eea35ffc6f1c664b3a4383ee","created_at":1781916570,"content":"またこれやってる\nhttps://i.nostr.build/5TqIzkdXWl3psESY.png","tags":[["r","https://i.nostr.build/5TqIzkdXWl3psESY.png"],["imeta","url https://i.nostr.build/5TqIzkdXWl3psESY.png","ox 5c11129293eb89ef666ef82295e4f871c042000c91f59f0441ad880a072fdfa5","x 1da45e7facb652b4b6ff506e6fbb27cf07be57c935b92ae4e19d22ee90037b66","m image/png","dim 238x176","bh LGQJWJ~o?Js=rqoH8^Di~WW=Rixu","blurhash LGQJWJ~o?Js=rqoH8^Di~WW=Rixu","thumb https://i.nostr.build/thumb/5TqIzkdXWl3psESY.png"]]}
{"id":"1e7589a98a9fa88e50052a1e3e1fe6760b9b6e35c2916e81091a6e19fe53e898","pubkey":"d679b0f4c94843077301c920480c9d2f2d12c9fa6d10352e134eb1c08229ac9a","created_at":1781916445,"content":"David Blane is in Thailand with bees. He is attempting a bee beard (in black, not recommended)…he got 10 stings.\n\nhttps://image.nostr.build/236441666d0f86cf2cc31c6b7d6f5ce859bdc7072a843274a14b7ce31ff62669.jpg","tags":[["imeta","url https://image.nostr.build/236441666d0f86cf2cc31c6b7d6f5ce859bdc7072a843274a14b7ce31ff62669.jpg","blurhash eK9QO3niI8Rj#lbaj?WAa$og9Df+%OjZS$V_WFxbfgR#xvadRiozni","dim 4032x3024"],["r","https://image.nostr.build/236441666d0f86cf2cc31c6b7d6f5ce859bdc7072a843274a14b7ce31ff62669.jpg"],["client","Damus"]]}
{"id":"8c334542814f0af3e36d5ef63b4a4e6052f6a9eb04dcd9d6bf467c33f33650d1","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1781916330,"content":"The difference between fiat empire and Bitcoin is the location of the compromise point.\nhttps://nostr.download/08b6b78657ac4190688c73b4010bbc04b3910e41e17eacfd3e4037bad994b1fb.jpg\nFiat empire fails at the center.\n\nCapture the issuer.\nCapture the regulator.\nCapture the court.\nCapture the bank.\nCapture the cloud.\nCapture the narrative.\n\nThe compromise can happen before the public even knows a decision was made.\n\nMoney is created upstream.\nRisk is socialized downstream.\nTruth arrives late, already edited by power.\n\nBitcoin inverts the timing.\n\nThere is no central mint to capture.\nNo emergency committee to bribe.\nNo private root key that signs reality into existence.\nNo priesthood that can silently rewrite the ledger.\n\nThe compromise point is pushed outward to every node.\n\nEvery block must arrive in public.\nEvery transaction must face verification.\nEvery lie must pay the cost of being checked by the whole network.\n\nFiat says: trust the institution now, audit the damage later.\n\nBitcoin says: verify the state now, reject the damage before it settles.\n\nThat is the security model break.\n\nEmpire secures power by hiding the moment of compromise.\n\nBitcoin secures value by making the moment of compromise impossible to hide.\n\nThe center cannot be captured because the center is not there.\n\n#Bitcoin #Verification #FiatEmpire #ProofOfWork #SoundMoney #TrustMinimized #DamageBDD #RunYourNode","tags":[["alt","A short note: The difference between fiat empire and Bitcoin is ..."],["t","Bitcoin"],["t","bitcoin"],["t","Verification"],["t","verification"],["t","FiatEmpire"],["t","fiatempire"],["t","ProofOfWork"],["t","proofofwork"],["t","SoundMoney"],["t","soundmoney"],["t","TrustMinimized"],["t","trustminimized"],["t","DamageBDD"],["t","damagebdd"],["t","RunYourNode"],["t","runyournode"],["r","https://nostr.download/08b6b78657ac4190688c73b4010bbc04b3910e41e17eacfd3e4037bad994b1fb.jpg"],["imeta","url https://nostr.download/08b6b78657ac4190688c73b4010bbc04b3910e41e17eacfd3e4037bad994b1fb.jpg","x 08b6b78657ac4190688c73b4010bbc04b3910e41e17eacfd3e4037bad994b1fb","size 218964","m image/jpeg","dim 1122x1402","blurhash _99Z+ZbwIV$$9ZNGRP?vkXoeWAR*ayRj_NoeRjWXs9s.NG.9oIoKogrrWBNG?Ge-R*ozozbbV@-:adWBozg3bbWBxuWAoft7bbofRj?HWBRjt6R-ofR*NHbcofaej]aeof","ox 08b6b78657ac4190688c73b4010bbc04b3910e41e17eacfd3e4037bad994b1fb"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
